  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "0B870AB70EFDD96D",
      "text": "Na, wenn das nicht [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ist![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "0B8707B70EFDD454",
      "text": "Wie ich sehe, kommst du mit dem Sammeln\\nder Arenaorden gut voran.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_01",
      "hash64": "964B979853F50DFD",
      "text": "Ach, ist das etwa [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1614,0000)]der Trainer, von demdie Trainerin, von der ich schon\\nso viel gehört hab?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1614",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_02",
      "hash64": "964B949853F508E4",
      "text": "Du sollst ja echt was auf dem Kasten haben.\\nIst da was dran?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0080_select_01",
      "hash64": "2A34295819C78B50",
      "text": "Aber hallo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0080_select_02",
      "hash64": "2A342C5819C79069",
      "text": "Na ja, geht so...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_03a",
      "hash64": "577A27D6A961A002",
      "text": "Bahaha! Also ein gesundes Selbstbewusstsein\\nhaste schon mal, ausgezeichnet![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_03b",
      "hash64": "577A26D6A9619E4F",
      "text": "Von wegen! Nur nicht so bescheiden![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "0B8708B70EFDD607",
      "text": "Darf ich vorstellen: Das ist Cay.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_04",
      "hash64": "964B929853F5057E",
      "text": "Jepp, das bin ich. Freut mich![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_05",
      "hash64": "964B939853F50731",
      "text": "Und ja, ich weiß, ich weiß, ich sehe umwerfend\\ngut aus. Aber lass dich davon nicht einschüchtern![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "0B8705B70EFDD0EE",
      "text": "Sie... lässt sich gerne mal zu Späßen hinreißen,\\nist aber ebenso wie ich ein Mitglied der Top Vier.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_06",
      "hash64": "964B909853F50218",
      "text": "Was? Ich hab doch gar keinen Scherz gemacht...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_07",
      "hash64": "964B919853F503CB",
      "text": "Hm... Na, egal.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_08",
      "hash64": "964B8E9853F4FEB2",
      "text": "Du machst jedenfalls einen interessanten ersten\\nEindruck, so viel steht fest.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "0B8706B70EFDD2A1",
      "text": "Selbstverständlich. Schließlich ist [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302,0000)]ersie Teil der\\nhervorragenden Schülerschaft unserer Akademie.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_09",
      "hash64": "964B8F9853F50065",
      "text": "Bahaha! Schon klar, schon klar.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_10",
      "hash64": "964EFC9853F7EF73",
      "text": "Hör mal, die Arenen werden richtig schwer,\\nsobald du die Hälfte von ihnen geschafft hast.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "0B8703B70EFDCD88",
      "text": "Das stimmt. Ab diesem Punkt gibt die Mehrheit\\nder Trainer letztendlich auf.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_11",
      "hash64": "964EFB9853F7EDC0",
      "text": "Aber du nicht, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_12",
      "hash64": "964EFE9853F7F2D9",
      "text": "Ich warte bei der Champ-Prüfung auf dich.\\nZeig den übrigen Arenen, was in dir steckt![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "0B8704B70EFDCF3B",
      "text": "Ja... Viel Erfolg dann mal.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
